        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>常用工具学习清单</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .header {\n    background: #1fc4b8;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    padding: 10px 12px 12px 12px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .content {\n    padding: 8px 14px 14px 14px;\n  }\n  .item {\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .num {\n    flex: 0 0 30px;\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 22px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n  }\n  .num.wide {\n    width: 34px;\n    flex: 0 0 34px;\n  }\n  .main {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    padding-left: 8px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .key {\n    color: #1fc4b8;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .underline {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: #1fc4b8;\n  }\n  .box {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1px solid #1fc4b8;\n    color: #1fc4b8;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .desc {\n    color: #1fa79c;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin: 2px 0 8px 38px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">画红线的是在我们摄影当中常用的工具可以着重学习</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num\">1</div>\n        <div class=\"main\">移动工具&nbsp;&nbsp;画板工具&nbsp;<span class=\"key\">(V)</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">移动选取或画面主题</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num\">2</div>\n        <div class=\"main\">套索工具&nbsp;&nbsp;多边形套索工具&nbsp;&nbsp;磁性套索&nbsp;<span class=\"key\">(L)</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">创建手绘选取</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n        <div class=\"main\">裁剪工具&nbsp;&nbsp;透视裁剪工具&nbsp;&nbsp;切片工具&nbsp;<span class=\"key\">(C)</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">裁切或扩展画面边缘</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num\">4</div>\n        <div class=\"main\"><span class=\"underline\">修补工具&nbsp;&nbsp;污点修复画笔工具&nbsp;&nbsp;修补工具&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;内容感知移动工具&nbsp;<span class=\"key\">(J)</span></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">去除瑕疵的常用工具</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num\">5</div>\n        <div class=\"main\">仿制图章工具&nbsp;&nbsp;图案图章工具&nbsp;<span class=\"key\">(S)</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">磨皮去瑕疵的常用工具</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num\">6</div>\n        <div class=\"main\">橡皮擦工具&nbsp;&nbsp;背景橡皮擦工具&nbsp;&nbsp;魔术橡皮擦工具&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"key\">(E)</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">擦除画面，经常结合蒙版使用</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num\">7</div>\n        <div class=\"main\">锐化工具&nbsp;&nbsp;模糊工具&nbsp;&nbsp;涂抹工具&nbsp;&nbsp;锐化图像中的柔边</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">锐化图像柔边</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num\">8</div>\n        <div class=\"main\">钢笔工具&nbsp;&nbsp;自由钢笔工具&nbsp;&nbsp;弯度钢笔工具&nbsp;&nbsp;添加描点工具&nbsp;&nbsp;删除描点工具<br>删除描点工具&nbsp;&nbsp;转换点工具&nbsp;<span class=\"key\">(P)</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">抠图常用工具</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num\">9</div>\n        <div class=\"main\">路径选择工具&nbsp;&nbsp;直接选择工具&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"key\">(A)</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">选择抠图路径一般结合钢笔工具使用</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num wide\">10</div>\n        <div class=\"main\">抓手工具<span class=\"key\">(H)</span>或<span class=\"box\">空格</span>&nbsp;旋转视图工具<span class=\"key\">(R)</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">拖动整个图像的工具</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num wide\">11</div>\n        <div class=\"main\">矩形选框工具&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;椭圆选框工具<span class=\"key\">(M)</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">创建矩形或圆形选取</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"num wide\">12</div>\n        <div class=\"main\">快速选择工具&nbsp;&nbsp;魔棒工具<span class=\"key\">(W)</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"desc\">选择色彩类似的图像区域</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
